ida</surname><given-names>HM</given-names></name><name><surname>Catto-Smith</surname><given-names>AG</given-names></name><name><surname>Gall</surname><given-names>DG</given-names></name><name><surname>Trevenen</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Scott</surname><given-names>RB</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Allergic colitis in infancy: clinical and pathologic aspects</article-title><source>J Pediatr Gastroenterol Nutr</source><year>1994</year><volume>19</volume><fpage>22</fpage><lpage>26</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7965472</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B11"><label>11</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Anveden-Hertzberg</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Finkel</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Sandstedt</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Karpe</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Proctocolitis in exclusively breast-fed infants</article-title><source>Eur J Pediatr</source><year>1996</year><volume>155</volume><fpage>464</fpage><lpage>467</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8789762</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B12"><label>12</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pumberger</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Pomberger</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Geissler</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Proctocolitis in breast fed infants: a constribution to differential diagnosis of hematochezia in early childhood</article-title><source>Postgrad Med J</source><year>2001</year><volume>77</volume><fpage>252</fpage><lpage>254</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11264489</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B13"><label>13</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><pe